#: ../../tools/open_meteo_climate_tools.rst:31 52037861fc754c11be0a1b15b6f1b486
msgid "**Type**: ``BaseRESTTool``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_climate_tools.rst:32 6b08309b512247838ac609776a075553
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get historical daily climate data for any location on "
"Earth using the Open-Meteo Climate Change API. Returns daily temperature,"
" precipitation, wind, humidity, and other variables from climate "
"reanalysis models (ERA5, EC-Earth3P\\_HR, CMIP6). Data available from "
"1950 onwards. No authentication required. Useful for climate research, "
"trend analysis, and historical weather studies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_climate_tools.rst:34 ffdc5edd30924cefba23965dfc0e1165
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_climate_tools.rst:36 12ae23226aa244cc99b1732a958130b0
msgid ""
"``latitude`` (number) (required) Location latitude (-90 to 90). Examples:"
" 52.52 (Berlin), 40.71 (NYC), 48.85 (Paris)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_climate_tools.rst:39 b56d5d9e0f2b4a8db795484b601227a6
msgid ""
"``longitude`` (number) (required) Location longitude (-180 to 180). "
"Examples: 13.41 (Berlin), -74.01 (NYC), 2.35 (Paris)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_climate_tools.rst:42 051d1ef6282a475eab371452ab448248
msgid ""
"``start_date`` (string) (required) Start date in YYYY-MM-DD format. Data "
"available from 1950-01-01. Examples: '1980-01-01', '2000-06-01', "
"'2020-01-01'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_climate_tools.rst:45 b66af769bdef4015a293e629ca172a8a
msgid ""
"``end_date`` (string) (required) End date in YYYY-MM-DD format. Examples:"
" '1980-12-31', '2000-06-30', '2023-12-31'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_climate_tools.rst:48 6e5118d3d15744c186bb36245d60ca2b
msgid ""
"``daily`` (string, null) (optional) Comma-separated daily variables. "
"Values: 'temperature\\_2m\\_mean', 'temperature\\_2m\\_max', "
"'temperature\\_2m\\_min', 'precipitation\\_sum', 'rain\\_sum', "
"'snowfall\\_sum', 'wind\\_speed\\_10m\\_max', "
"'et0\\_fao\\_evapotranspiration'. Default: "
"temperature\\_2m\\_mean,precipitation\\_sum"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_climate_tools.rst:51 1195564fcd8e45eb9cba9edd6fa4a504
msgid ""
"``models`` (string, null) (optional) Climate model. Values: "
"'EC\\_Earth3P\\_HR' (Europe, high res), 'MPI\\_ESM1\\_2\\_XR', "
"'FGOALS\\_f3\\_H', 'CMCC\\_CM2\\_VHR4'. Default: EC\\_Earth3P\\_HR"
msgstr ""

